# Two thirds and a million in Russian: fractions and per cent
subtitle: "Две трети гостей, двадцать процентов, ноль целых пять десятых: fractions, per cent and millions in Russian, with «Нева»'s year in numbers."
tags: ["russian","fractions in russian","per cent","russian numbers","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/fractions","grammar/numerals-in-cases","vocabulary/money"]
thumb: "band \"Two thirds, in Russian\" stamp \"2/3\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Her own books in Russian: свой, своя, своих","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/177-russian-their-own.cast"}

